#: ../../tools/diseasesh_tools.rst:32 0750add8ed3045878bc739a3dbe3b186
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get COVID-19 statistics for a specific country from the "
"Disease.sh API. Returns total and daily cases, deaths, recovered, active,"
" critical, testing data, and per-million rates. Also includes country "
"metadata (population, continent, flag image, latitude/longitude). Accepts"
" country name, ISO2, ISO3, or country ID. Example: 'USA', 'US', 'United "
"States' all return US data. Useful for comparing pandemic impact across "
"nations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/diseasesh_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/diseasesh_tools.rst:65
